  triage:description "quality-mgr qa-pr1310-r8 (PR #1310, AY.15 herdr-name-uniqueness, head 715ab21ea; report: PR #1310 issuecomment 5576239134). quality-mgr ATM-QA-001 (req-qa). docs/plans/phase-ay/herdr-naming-test-matrix.md:36 row A-17 (T1:bob alias bobby, add T1:sam alias bobby, expect reject) cites 'validate_database_wide_aliases in-roster check (roster_store.rs:204)': validate_database_wide_aliases has zero matches in crates/ and roster_store.rs:204 is inside load_unique_names. No named test covers the A-17 scenario, so AC1 (every section-A row maps to a named test) is violated for this row only. Correction: add a named test for same-team alias duplicate rejection through enforce_roster_unique_names and update the A-17 citation to that test." ;
